actually still contain the blocks corresponding to shadowed attributes."],"path":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/plan/physical/LookupJoinExec.java","id":36728,"created_at":"2024-12-10T10:51:47Z","original_position":9,"side":"RIGHT","position":9,"original_start_line":96,"submitted_on_commit":"d3b3dc627eaf45d3a255b1e3e5293fc31b395231","diff_hunk":"@@ -93,9 +93,9 @@ public List\u003cAttribute\u003e addedFields() {\n     public List\u003cAttribute\u003e output() {\n         if (lazyOutput \u003d\u003d null) {\n             lazyOutput \u003d new ArrayList\u003c\u003e(left().output());\n-            for (Attribute attr : addedFields) {\n-                lazyOutput.add(attr);\n-            }\n+            var addedFieldsNames \u003d addedFields.stream().map(Attribute::name).toList();\n+            lazyOutput.removeIf(a -\u003e addedFieldsNames.contains(a.name()));\n+            lazyOutput.addAll(addedFields);","submitted_start_line":96,"submitted_line":98},"generatedCommentsNodes":[{"comment":"The modification in `output` method of `LookupJoinExec` could lead to incorrect results if there are duplicate attribute names in `addedFields`. The removal of attributes based on name comparison without considering their other properties (like type or source) might unintentionally remove necessary fields.","nodes":[{"id":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/plan/physical/LookupJoinExec.java-x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/plan/physical/LookupJoinExec.java-3425:3513-3425:3499,3512:3574,3587:3618","promptId":"#1NCJM","srcPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/plan/physical/LookupJoinExec.java","dstPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/plan/physical/LookupJoinExec.java","srcChanges":[{"pos":3425,"endPos":3513,"startLine":96,"startLineOffset":12,"endLine":98,"endLineOffset":13,"length":89}],"dstChanges":[{"pos":3425,"endPos":3499,"startLine"